---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="container mx-auto mt-20 sm:mt-32 mb-12 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center sm:items-baseline gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <div>
            &copy; {currentYear} Ruben Boone.
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 font-mono text-xs">
            <a href="mailto:ruben.boone@uhasselt.be" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">Email</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/rubenboone" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/rubenboone" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center sm:items-baseline mt-4 text-xs text-gray-600">
        <p>Steering LLM personalities before they steer us.</p>
        <p class="font-mono mt-2 sm:mt-0">Built with <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> & <a href="https://tailwindcss.com/">Tailwind</a></p>
    </div>
</footer>
